BG_QLRules): on a g_ruleset ql server it predicts Quake Live's refire times and draws the 20 pellets in fixed rings
the game traces (CG_ShotgunPattern), where it predicted id's times and drew id's 11 random pellets; under id's
rules, and on id's game, Pmove gets no rules as before. The game's commands the cgame has no use for ("readyup",
